# Qwen2.5-32B-Instruct (dense, no thinking mode), official AWQ INT4 (AutoAWQ GEMM, group 128,
# zero point; AWQ-Marlin); fp16 activations as declared. The template injects Qwen's default system
# prompt ("You are Qwen, created by Alibaba Cloud. ...") when the conversation has no system
# message: the default question_first layout sends one, state_first does not.
# Measured on an RTX 3090 (docs/research/candidates.md): 18.14 GiB weights, 2.52 GiB KV cache
# (10,336 tokens), ~70 s to healthy.
# Text-only checkpoint (no --language-model-only); --max-num-batched-tokens=1024 and
# --max-num-seqs=16 as in the Qwen3.5-architecture presets; --generation-config=vllm ignores the
# upload's sampling defaults.
JEVEMU_VLLM_MODEL=Qwen/Qwen2.5-32B-Instruct-AWQ
JEVEMU_VLLM_MODEL_REVISION=5c7cb76a268fc6cfbb9c4777eb24ba6e27f9ee6c
JEVEMU_VLLM_DTYPE=auto
JEVEMU_VLLM_MAX_MODEL_LEN=8192
JEVEMU_VLLM_GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION=0.95
JEVEMU_VLLM_DEFAULT_CHAT_TEMPLATE_KWARGS=
JEVEMU_VLLM_EXTRA_ARGS='--max-num-seqs=16 --max-num-batched-tokens=1024 --generation-config=vllm'
